{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29755338\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述了 PPN、中脑运动区与基底节输出对步态的调控，可作为 STN 之外脑干运动网络参与 FOG 的竞争性机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29755729\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为帕金森病 DBS 的一般性社论且无摘要，未提供 STN 神经活动与 FOG 关系的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29773512\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅报告 FOG 患者足着地变异性的运动学特征，未涉及 STN 神经活动或能够解释 STN-FOG 关系的神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29796409\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过认知训练改善 FOG 并发现药物 ON/OFF 状态差异，支持执行功能和认知网络参与 FOG 的竞争性机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29846707\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究 PPN/cMRF 区 DBS 治疗 FOG 的有效电极位置及疗效异质性，可用于比较脑干与 STN 靶点的作用机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29856153\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"比较 SMA 与运动皮层刺激对 FOG 的影响，提供皮层运动网络参与 FOG 的直接干预证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29867708\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"发现 FOG 量表与左旋多巴反应的关联取决于反应计算方法，提示药物反应评估方式可能是 STN-FOG 研究结果差异的临床混杂因素。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29879292\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论一般性基底节功能及皮质-基底节同步化，未涉及 FOG 或 STN 特异性证据，与核心研究问题联系不足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29899724\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究未按 FOG 状态分组的帕金森病双任务步态稳定性，未提供 STN 活动或 FOG 特异性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29902470\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然纳入 FOG 患者，但主要研究足部机械刺激对步态变异性的影响，未检验 FOG 神经机制或 STN 活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29902715\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较有无 FOG 患者保护性迈步前的预期姿势调整，提示姿势调整幅度并非 FOG 差异的主要来源，有助于区分姿势控制与冻结机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29903649\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述帕金森病步行和平衡时的皮层活动及其任务依赖性和测量异质性，可为皮层-基底节网络机制及 STN 步态信号的结果差异提供背景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29941788\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过 GPi 和 PPN 区 LFP 记录证明 GPi-DBS 能调节 PPN theta 活动及双侧连接，为基底节输出影响脑干运动网络提供直接生理证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29956025\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接检验 SMA tDCS 对 FOG 患者步态启动的影响并发现无显著疗效，可用于分析皮层靶点、刺激方案及步态启动障碍之间的机制差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29961369\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述和荟萃分析揭示转弯时 FOG 的运动学特征及任务复杂度效应，可解释不同步态任务条件下 STN 神经活动研究结果的差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29973489\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然样本量很小，但同时报告 FOG-Q 改善和 P300 改变，为皮层认知-运动网络参与 FOG 提供初步电生理证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29977280\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要评估动作观察康复对 FOG 的临床疗效，未测量神经活动或检验特定脑网络机制，不能直接帮助解释 STN-FOG 关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29985119\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过 FDG-PET 和神经心理学比较发现 FOG 患者存在更明显的额叶低代谢及执行功能障碍，支持额叶-基底节环路异常这一竞争性机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:29989948\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要开发基于惯性传感器的 FOG 检测算法，未涉及神经生理机制或 STN 活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:30035024\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接记录 STN LFP 并比较行走、静息及刺激状态下的振荡和双侧连接变化，是研究 STN 步态相关神经活动的核心原始证据，同时揭示运动伪迹这一重要方法学问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:30065694\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较有无 FOG 患者的扰动后姿势反应，提示反应性姿势控制与冻结可能由不同机制调控，有助于区分脑干姿势控制和 FOG 相关机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:30070204\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究脊髓刺激对 FOG 和预期姿势调整的影响，并提出 SMA 相关皮层运动通路参与，为 STN 之外的 FOG 调控网络提供干预证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:30078828\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述明确讨论 FOG 的病理生理学及基底节、额叶和视觉联合皮层的运动控制作用，可提供 STN 所属网络的理论机制框架。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:30086388\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过 MPTP 灵长类模型记录 cMRF/PPN 神经元放电，提出 burst 放电可能参与 FOG，并质疑基底节输出过度抑制脑干的假说，是比较竞争性机制的重要动物证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:30108543\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究 STN-DBS 临床疗效，但仅报告总体 UPDRS、药物剂量和生活质量等指标，未提供 FOG 特异性结局或 STN 神经活动证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f3456aca-2baa-4469-a01a-73d3f12ca489", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T153322244999Z", "elapsed_seconds": 198.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:36:41.151619+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e530e94c2380762c4eb3df37ff2329cdafb72947bb957a05112ebfbfe7c7bbdc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T153322244999Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "96accb82aaa597e89e7ca80c2cd5c0728acc63da06cb47a7b501c6c8cd992971"}}}
